('Fatal Autonomous Vehicle Crash (Uber/Volvo)', 'Fatal Autonomous Vehicle Crash (Uber/Volvo)', 'A self-driving test vehicle struck and killed a pedestrian crossing the street at night in Tempe, Arizona. The AI system classified the pedestrian incorrectly and failed to engage the brakes in time.', 'A self-driving test vehicle struck and killed a pedestrian crossing the street at night in Tempe, Arizona. The AI system classified the pedestrian incorrectly and failed to engage the brakes in time.', 'security', 'critical', 'published', 18400, '2018-03-18'),
